00:03:54,709 --> 00:03:56,000
The situation is much worse

111
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,020
If I tell you

112
00:03:57,020 --> 00:03:58,440
When you send a user message

113
00:03:58,440 --> 00:03:59,460
it will be sent once

114
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:01,320
